as Cove, TX 76522\r\n$182,500, 3 bed, 2.00 bath, 1,128 SF, MLS# 602389\r\n\r\nThe sellers are willing to have their loan assumed by qualified buyers! Talk to your loan officer! Welcome to this well-maintained 3 bedroom/2 bathroom home with a comfortable living space (ceiling fans everywhere and a fireplace) and peace of mind with a new roof and HVAC installed last year. You will find a bright and functional layout for everyday living. Fresh paint in the living area and master bedroom with new flooring in the kitchen. The living area flows into the kitchen and dining space making it ideal for relaxing or entertaining.\r\nThe backyard is just right for kids, pets, or your own personal outdoor retreat.\r\nThe location is a standout feature! It is only 8 minutes from Fort Hood. It is also walking distance from the neighborhood schools including the junior high and high school. You also have convenient access to shopping and restaurants.\r\n\r\n2 full bath\r\n\r\nFor more information, please contact: \r\nRobert Herrings\r\nJR Rentals & Property Management\r\n254-547-9994 or robertherringsjr@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\nAGENT SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: http://forthoodrentalproperties.com/\r\nShowcase: https://view.paradym.com/s/Robert-Herrings-JR-Rentals--Property-Management/284510\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100063905801693\r\n\r\nCOMPANY SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: https://www.century21premierrealtors.com/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Century21PremierRealtors/\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/herringsrobert/\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/c21pbroker\r\nLinkedIn: https://www.Linkedin.com/in/hrherrings/\r\nPinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/jrherrings/\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZvWg96vLbA3eGHCwnf3RRQ", "channel_id": "UCZvWg96vLbA3eGHCwnf3RRQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZvWg96vLbA3eGHCwnf3RRQ", "duration": 63, "view_count": 0, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https